sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Web as Next.js
  participant API as Laravel API
  participant S3 as Object Storage
  participant Queue as Redis Queue
  participant Worker as Python Worker
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  User->>Web: Upload transcript or recording
  Web->>API: POST /meetings/{id}/artifacts
  API->>S3: Store immutable source artifact
  API->>DB: Create artifact record
  API->>Queue: Dispatch ProcessMeetingArtifact
  API-->>Web: 202 Accepted
  Queue->>Worker: POST /v1/transcribe with signed URL
  Worker->>S3: Download artifact
  Worker-->>Queue: Normalized speaker segments
  Queue->>DB: Create transcript version and segments
  Queue->>DB: Mark meeting ready
  Web->>API: GET /meetings/{id}
  API-->>Web: Meeting, artifacts and transcript
